//   4. MOUNT SULK — smoking volcano, east
//   5. PALM OF SECOND THOUGHTS — palm forest, west
//   6. THE GIGGLING LAGOON — lagoon, south-centre
//   7. SKULL COVE — cove, south-east
//   8. THE SHIVERING SEA — the surrounding ocean
//   + CAPTAIN BARNABY'S HOARD — the red X destination, centre.

